  "text": "proprium.dominica-i-post-epiphaniam-communio",
  "about": "The communio of the formulary “Mass of the First Sunday after Epiphany” in the 1962 Roman Missal. This formulary serves the weekdays of that week. On the Sunday itself the feast of the Holy Family takes its place.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Son, why hast Thou done so to us? Thy father and I have been seeking Thee sorrowing. How is it that ye sought Me? Did ye not know that I must be about those things which are My Father’s?" }
